                                                                             "content":  "=You are generating cinematic inspirational image prompts.\n\nYour task is to return EXACTLY 3 items in a valid JSON array.\n\nEach item must contain:\n{\n  \"prompt\": \"full combined image generation prompt\"\n}\n\nEach prompt must include:\n\n1. A short HOPE-FILLED inspirational message (maximum 20 words).\n   - Deeply uplifting.\n   - Reassuring.\n   - Encouraging strength, healing, growth, new beginnings.\n   - May gently reference God in a comforting way (not preachy).\n   - Must feel powerful and emotionally warm.\n   - No emojis.\n   - No hashtags.\n   - Each message must be different.\n\n2. A cinematic indoor background scene ONLY.\n   - Indoor setting (quiet bedroom, warm living room, soft curtain window light, gentle morning light through window, warm lamp glow, minimalist peaceful interior).\n   - Calm, quiet, hopeful atmosphere.\n   - Soft natural lighting preferred.\n   - Dark cinematic tones but gentle and warm.\n   - Realistic photography.\n   - Subtle film grain.\n   - Shallow depth of field.\n   - No outdoor elements.\n   - Each background must be different.\n\nSTRICT DESIGN REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n\nQUOTE TEXT:\n- Centered in the middle.\n- Typewriter-style font.\n- Font size: 120px.\n- Font color: pure white (#FFFFFF).\n- No background.\n- No border.\n- No outline.\n- No stroke.\n- No shadow.\n- No glow.\n- Plain solid white text only.\n- Must be the dominant visual element.\n\nWATERMARK:\n- Text must be EXACTLY: @unique_names\n- Preserve the underscore.\n- Do NOT modify the text.\n- Bottom center placement.\n- Same typewriter-style font.\n- Font size: 24px.\n- Font color: white (#FFFFFF).\n- Opacity: 30%.\n- No shadow.\n- No outline.\n- Subtle watermark appearance only.\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- Return ONLY a valid JSON array.\n- No explanation.\n- No markdown.\n- No text before or after the JSON.\n- The array must contain exactly 3 objects.\n- Each object must contain only the \"prompt\" field."
                                                                         }
                                                                     ]
